Upstream-Name: Stud
Upstream-Contact: CatPieLeaf <catpieleaf@proton.me>
Source: https://github.com/CatPieLeaf/Stud
Comment:
 Stud contains no Roblox code and distributes none. It downloads Roblox's
 macOS client from Roblox's own servers onto the machine it runs on, and
 that client is not part of this package.
 .
 The full text of every licence named here ships in the binary package
 under /usr/share/licenses/stud/, one directory per component. Where a
 licence is long and already on the system, this file names that path
 rather than repeating it.

