Comment:
 /usr/libexec/stud/rosemary, which runs the macOS client. Built from
 https://github.com/CatPieLeaf/rosemary-stud, branch stud: upstream
 Rosemary (https://github.com/microlift/rosemary) with Stud's changes on
 top. That branch is its Corresponding Source. AGPLv3 section 13 permits
 combining it with Stud and conveying the result.

